## Setup for Lecturer

1. git clone https://github.com/zionkits170-sudo/farmconnect-frontend.git
2. cd farmconnect-frontend
3. npm install
4. cp .env.example .env
5. Edit .env: VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
6. npm run dev -> http://localhost:5173

## New Features Added (M26B13/019)

1. Database-backed Favourites - persists across browsers via /api/favorites
2. Ratings & Reviews - star rating 1-5 via /api/reviews/product/:id
3. Advanced Search & Filtering - search, category, price filters via query params

